  "fun_fact": "Art is one of our most powerful tools in the fight against climate change. Through stories, street plays, poems and paintings, it has long carried complex ideas in ways that are engaging and easy to grasp. Yet many of India's traditional art forms are quietly fading from daily life — preserving them, and the voices they carry, is vital for both our culture and our climate conversation. <a href=\"https://catterfly.art/blog-detail/whispers-of-fading-hues-the-dying-art-of-india?srsltid=AfmBOorBtJhuKLvQCFQwwp4WjdAE7XC-FHC9IvcPFQj_ag556MLU8QG2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read more →</a>",
